<title>UK: N.Ireland Electric to fight Ofreg in court.</title>
<headline>N.Ireland Electric to fight Ofreg in court.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility Northern Ireland Electricity Plc said on Friday it would seek a judicial review to contest price cuts proposed by its regulator, Ofreg.</p>
</text>
